        "original_id": "a9227621-8c73-56b2-b853-b1e8467bbb73",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Shery, Cristian Castro\n- Places: Guatemala, New York City, Mexico\n- Roles: singer, songwriter\n- Organizations: John Lennon Songwriting Contest\n- Works: \"El amor es un fantasma\", \"En la vida y para siempre\"\n\nFacts:\n- Cristian Sáez Valdés Castro was born on 8 December 1974 and is a Mexican pop/rock singer who is also referred to as Christian Castro or Cristian.\n- Shery was born on August 18, 1985 and is a Guatemalan Latin pop singer and songwriter.\n- Shery wrote the original compositions \"El amor es un fantasma\" and \"En la vida y para siempre.\"\n- Shery's songs \"El amor es un fantasma\" and \"En la vida y para siempre\" were finalists in the John Lennon Songwriting Contest in New York City.",
